      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -64
      ],
      "id": "e54d6140-7821-4e08-bb7d-ec9c2078889d",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## **Get Weekly Risks**\n\n1. **Get Weekly Risks (Google Sheets)**  \n   - Retrieves unsummarised risk entries from the **Risk Register Log** sheet in Google Sheets.  \n   - Connects to the spreadsheet **“Risk Register”** using the linked Google Sheets account.  \n   - Filters data based on the **\"Summarised?\"** column to identify new risks that need inclusion in the weekly report.\n\n2. **Aggregate (Data Aggregation)**  \n   - Aggregates all retrieved risk data into a single structured dataset.  \n   - Prepares the data for further processing and generation of the **Weekly Risk Summary Report**.\n",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 416
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -256,
        -304
      ],
      "id": "0ef63ba6-2a4b-4f63-8fda-372a50bbaacd",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## **Weekly Risk Dashboard Generator**\n\n1. **Risk Summariser (AI Agent)**  \n   - Uses an **AI-powered assistant (GPT-4.1)** to transform the raw risk data into a structured weekly summary.  \n   - Follows a pre-defined **HTML dashboard template** styled with inline CSS for email or web embedding.  \n   - Automatically fills in total risk counts, severity breakdowns, top risks, and category summaries.\n\n2. **Format Date (Code Node)**  \n   - Generates the current date in a readable format (e.g., “10/14/2025”).  \n   - Adds a `todayFormatted` field to timestamp the generated summary.  \n   - Ensures each report reflects the accurate date of creation.\n",
        "height": 768,
        "width": 576
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        176,
        -304
      ],
      "id": "fa27bb76-eb96-40b3-9287-695afa0bef57",
      "name": "Sticky Note2"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## **Send Risk Register Summary Email**\n\n1. **Send Risk Register Summary Email (Gmail)**  \n   - Sends the **Weekly Risk Summary Report** via Gmail to the **Chief Risk Officer (CRO)**.  \n   - The **email body** is populated with the AI-generated HTML summary from the previous node.  \n   - Automatically **CCs the Risk Management Team** for visibility.  \n",
        "height": 464,
        "width": 432,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        768,
        -176
      ],
      "id": "324d1a0e-5b37-4c8b-865b-7840757e067d",
      "name": "Sticky Note3"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## **Update Summary Status**\n\n1. **Update Summary Status (Google Sheets)**  \n   - Updates the **“Summarised?”** column in the **Risk Register Log** Google Sheet.  \n   - Marks each processed risk entry as **“Yes”** once included in the weekly summary.  \n   - Helps prevent duplicate entries from being re-summarised in future reports.  \n",
        "height": 464,
        "width": 384,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        176,
        480
      ],
      "id": "3db0a5c0-7d54-43c2-86a6-ea3264119c8c",
      "name": "Sticky Note4"
    }
